        }
      ],
      "extract": "PARAMETER BASED INTRANUCLEAR CASCADE MODEL We now discuss in detail the physical content of our INC and how several ingredients were incorporated in the model. The INC starts by generating a nuclear con- ﬁguration, which describes the spatial distribution of pro- tons and neutrons inside the nucleus. A large number of these conﬁgurations are computed from quantum Monte Carlo (QMC) methods [50] that use as input the",
      "extractCut": true
    },
    {
