      "extract": "To check if an interaction between nucleons occurs, an accept-reject test is performed on the closest nucleon according to a probability distribution $P(b)$ (see e.g. Ref. [@Sjostrand:1987su] for similar considerations) where $b$ is the impact parameter. We impose two conditions on this probability, $$\\label{eq:int_prob_conds} P(0)=1\\quad\\textrm{and}\\quad \\int_0^{2\\pi}\\int_0^\\infty d\\varphi \\,b db P(b) = \\sigma,$$",
